    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swing, fling, and cause chaos with your shoes in this physics-based mayhem. Discover secrets, unlock bonus levels and fill your journal with shiny stickers. Master the perfect throw to SHOE IT ALL!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GET READY TO SHOE IT ALL!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the unique swing-based aiming mechanic that challenges your precision and timing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978860/extras/0f15c6316b3a56da7dd265aa1ed933be.poster.avif?t=1755268414\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978860/extras/0f15c6316b3a56da7dd265aa1ed933be.webm?t=1755268414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978860/extras/0f15c6316b3a56da7dd265aa1ed933be.mp4?t=1755268414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PURE CHAOS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each throw sends your shoes flying into destructible environments where chain reactions spark wild destruction and hilarious surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978860/extras/7692222088791920ead4bc22e07736c3.poster.avif?t=1755268414\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978860/extras/7692222088791920ead4bc22e07736c3.webm?t=1755268414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978860/extras/7692222088791920ead4bc22e07736c3.mp4?t=1755268414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COLLECT IT ALL!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect shiny stickers, unlock secret and bonus levels and complete your journal filled with all your wildest shoe-flinging moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978860/extras/a0142dd87bfd626d396e1260d422f400.poster.avif?t=1755268414\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978860/extras/a0142dd87bfd626d396e1260d422f400.webm?t=1755268414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978860/extras/a0142dd87bfd626d396e1260d422f400.mp4?t=1755268414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
